  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Health Procurement Project (FHPP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fiji Health Procurement Project is an initiative aimed at ensuring timely and quality delivery of health products to the Fiji Ministry of Health and Medical Services (MHMS) from WHO pre-qualified suppliers in an affordable prices and acceptable lead time. The project aims at improving the HIV, TB and STI treatment in the country contributing to improvement of the overall health of the targeted population groups in Fiji.</narrative>
  </description>
